# Sigma

> Build and run AI apps, dashboards, and agents on governed warehouse data. Sigma lets every team build with chat, a spreadsheet, SQL, or Python.

Sigma is the AI runtime for business. A governed platform where teams build and run AI apps and agents directly on live cloud warehouse data (Snowflake, Databricks, BigQuery, Redshift). Ask in natural language, build agents that act on your data, write back to close the loop, and analyze in a familiar spreadsheet interface, all governed.

## Product
- [Sigma Agents](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/agents): Govern data, improve performance, and do it all at scale with Sigma's Agents.
- [AI Toolkit](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/ai): Bring AI to analysis and workflows on live warehouse data. Ask questions, build faster, and use LLM functions in spreadsheet cells.
- [AI Applications](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/ai-applications): Build powerful AI-driven apps on your cloud data. Take action customized to your team’s needs without writing any code.
- [AI Apps Manifesto](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/ai-apps-manifesto): Data analysis in spreadsheets. The way you already know how to. You don’t need coding skills to analyze massive datasets in Sigma. You can do all your work in columns and rows.
- [Architecture](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/architecture): Sigma is a spreadsheet UI on top of your cloud data warehouse. Filters, group-bys, pivots, and formulas compile into SQL in your warehouse's dialect, run where the data lives, and return results to the browser.
- [Business Intelligence & Analytics on Warehouse Data](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/business-intelligence): Dashboards, spreadsheets, Sigma Reveal, SQL/Python, and Ask Sigma on live warehouse data. Drill into records and standardize metrics with shared models.
- [Data Discovery with Reveal](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/data-discovery-reveal): Sigma Reveal is an interactive data discovery tool that lets you pivot, group, and uncover insights instantly. No need for pre-built dashboards, SQL, complex controls, or bias-driven analysis paths.
- [Define once. Trust everywhere. Data Modeling](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/data-modeling): Governed metrics and reusable business definitions for scalable analytics and accurate AI context. Built on your cloud data warehouse.
- [Embedded Analytics and Apps](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/embedded-analytics): Embed white-label analytics and AI-powered apps in your product. Secure iFrames, themes, and multitenant controls built for scale.
- [Python / SQL](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/python-sql): You can now write Python code directly inside of Sigma Workbooks using live data from your warehouse. Combining your Python and SQL skills with the Excel style editor to unlock new layers of analysis not possible with any other tool.
- [Pixel-Perfect Reporting on Live Warehouse Data](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/reporting): Build board-ready, paginated reports with layout control, scheduled exports, and bursting. Govern distribution with row-level security.
- [Self-service](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/self-service): Get early access to our groundbreaking GPT-powered analytics features, integrated seamlessly within Sigma.
- [Sigma for dashboards and BI | Live on your warehouse](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/sigma-for-dashboards): Build dashboards and BI on live warehouse data, drill from a flagged metric to the row without a ticket, and cut a 30-hour build to 30 minutes.
- [Forecasting applications on live warehouse data | Sigma](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/sigma-for-forecasting): See how finance teams freeze every forecast version, rerun scenarios on live warehouse data, and retire an 18-tab spreadsheet forecast.
- [Modeling on live warehouse data | Sigma](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/sigma-for-modeling): See how business teams model pricing and commissions on live warehouse data, with approvals, audit history, and a day a week back.
- [Sigma for planning | Governed planning applications on live data](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/sigma-for-planning): Run planning in one governed app. Hundreds of planners submit at once, approvals lock the numbers, and every edit writes back to your warehouse.
- [Project tracking on live warehouse data | Sigma](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/sigma-for-project-tracking): Track projects on live warehouse data. Owners update status in the row, approvals route in Sigma, and every change lands under warehouse controls.
- [Sigma for reconciliation | Close on one governed number](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/sigma-for-reconciliation): See how finance teams run reconciliation live on the warehouse, explain each exception in the row, and cut a full day of copy-paste.
- [Sigma for reference data | Governed mappings and lookups](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/sigma-for-reference-data): Maintain mappings, hierarchies, and lookups in Sigma. Owners edit definitions directly, and every change writes back with an audit trail.
- [No-export spreadsheets on warehouse data](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/spreadsheets): A spreadsheet UI connected to live warehouse data. Use formulas, pivots, Input Tables, and audit trails to plan and analyze without exporting files.
- [Bug Bounty Policy & Form](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/vdp): If you believe you have discovered a security vulnerability issue, please share the details with Sigma Computing.
- [7 Reasons](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/why-sigma): There’s a better way to do business intelligence, and it starts with Sigma. See why teams of all sizes are leaving their legacy platforms behind.
- [Write-back](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/write-back): Explore Sigma's ability to allow users to combine real-time data and manual human inputs to perform completely new types of analysis through Input Tables.

## AI Applications
- [Budget Variance Analysis AI Application | Sigma](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/ai-applications/budget-variance-analysis): Compare budget to actuals on live warehouse data. Explain variances, capture commentary through governed writeback, and keep a full audit trail in Sigma AI Applications.
- [Capacity Planning AI Application | Planning on Live Warehouse Data](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/ai-applications/capacity-planning): Plan capacity on live warehouse data with governed writeback. Create and lock plans, roll up or split scenarios, track forecast vs actuals, and keep a complete audit trail in Sigma AI Applications.
- [Demand Planning AI Application | Sigma](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/ai-applications/demand-planning): Build demand forecasts on live warehouse data. Adjust assumptions through governed writeback, track forecast vs actuals, and keep every change auditable in Sigma AI Applications.
- [Go-to-Market Operations AI Application | Sigma AI Applications](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/ai-applications/go-to-market-operations): Sigma AI Applications power GTM Operations on live warehouse data. Monitor pipeline movement, bookings, new customers, and ASP by region/segment, then ask questions with AI to surface drivers and anomalies—governed, shareable, and always current.
- [Pipeline Forecasting AI Application](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/ai-applications/pipeline-forecasting): Forecast pipeline with scenarios, approvals, and an audit trail—directly on live warehouse data. A governed Pipeline Forecasting AI Application in Sigma.
- [Project Management AI Application](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/ai-applications/project-management): A Project Management AI Application that keeps tasks, priorities, and statuses aligned. Track project progress, identify bottlenecks, and optimize team efficiency powered by live warehouse data in Sigma.
- [Supply Chain Planning AI Application | Tariff Optimization](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/ai-applications/supply-chain-planning): Optimize tariff-adjusted COGS using live bill of materials data. Compare suppliers and countries, run scenarios, and quantify margin impact in a governed Sigma AI Application.
- [Territory Management AI Application | Sigma](https://www.sigmacomputing.com/product/ai-applications/territory-management): Design and balance sales territories on live warehouse data. Model assignments through governed writeback, track coverage and quota, and keep every change auditable in Sigma AI Applications.

